Valid options: ADD LIFE, CLEAR SUICIDE, ADD EVIL n, SPEAK xxx, CHANGE NAME, DISABLE TOPTEN, ENABLE TOPTEN, INVENTORY, PROFILE, SPELLS, POWERS, GOOD, SAINT, NEUTRAL, LAWFUL, UNLAWFUL, RETRAIN, ABILITIES
VERIFY ABILITIES, STATUS, INFO, CHANGE SEX, JAIL
